  "job_B17.1_20251003_114356": {
    "chunk_text": "& Bassianus his sunu Twa hund g\u00e6ra. Her \u00ferowade Sanctus Albanus martir. \u00d0reo hund g\u00e6ra. Her Gratianus feng to rice. Her Maximianus se casere feng to rice. He w\u00e6s on Bretenlonde geboren.& \u00feonne for in Gallia walas.& he \u00f0ar ofsloh \u00f0one casere & se Ualentinianus eft gesamnode werod, & ofsloh Maximum & feng to rice. On \u00feam timan aras Pelagies gedwyld geond middaneard. Her Gotan abr\u00e6con Romeburg, & n\u00e6fre si\u00fean Romane ne ricsodon on Bretone. \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s embe xi hund wintra & x wintra \u00fees \u00fee heo getimbred was. Ealles hi rixodon on Brytene feower hundwintra & hund seouanti wintra.sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00e6rost Gaius Iulius Her Romane gesomnodon al \u00fea goldhord \u00fee on Bretene w\u00e6ron, & sume on eor\u00fean ahyddon.\u00fe\u00e6t hie Her \u00f0eodosius se gingra feng to rice. Her Palladius vel Patricius se biscep w\u00e6s onsended to Scottum \u00fe\u00e6t he hiera geleafan trymede.from Her sendon Brytwalas to Rome.& heom fultomes b\u00e6don wi\u00f0 Piohtas.ac hi \u00fear n\u00e6fdan nanne, & \u00fea sendon hi to Anglum.& Angelcynnes \u00e6\u00f0elingas \u00f0\u00e6s ylcan b\u00e6dan. Her Martianus & Ualentines onfengon rice.& ricsodon vii winter. & on hiera dagum Hengest & Horsa from Wyrtgeorne gelea\u00feade Bretta kyninge gesohton Bretene Se cing het hi feohtan agien Pihtas.",
